 inputs hash moves. 0.6.2: a public fight moves Standing once, by whom the cell fought (fight.public, Sky 2026-10-16; retires 0.6.1's gunfire.heard). 0.6.1: a public gunfight costs Standing (gunfire.heard, Sky 2026-10-16). 0.6.0: brief 014 (private turning; Standing starts at +2, the word and the drift between missions). 0.5.0: brief 013 (takedowns, bodies, reports, the response dial, check-in marks)
